{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":9919,\"tags\":[],\"year\":2011,\"idMal\":9919,\"staff\":[{\"id\":16749,\"name\":\"Tensai Okamura\",\"role\":\"Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16750,\"name\":\"Kazuhiro Wakabayashi\",\"role\":\"Sound Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16751,\"name\":\"Shinpei Ezaki\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16752,\"name\":\"Yoshiyuki Fujiwara\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16753,\"name\":\"Shinya Kawatsura\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16754,\"name\":\"Toshimasa Kuroyanagi\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16755,\"name\":\"Tadahito Matsubayashi\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16756,\"name\":\"Atsushi Takahashi\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16757,\"name\":\"Ikuko Takahashi\",\"role\":\"Script\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":16758,\"name\":\"Takuya Igarashi\",\"role\":\"Storyboard\",\"image\":null}],\"title\":\"Blue Exorcist\",\"format\":\"TV\",\"genres\":[],\"poster\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/248035-14.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"season\":\"\",\"status\":\"FINISHED\",\"titles\":{\"ar\":\"المعوذ الأزرق\",\"bg\":\"Синият Екзорсист\",\"de\":\"Blue Exorcist\",\"el\":\"Ο Γαλάζιος Εξορκιστής\",\"en\":\"Blue Exorcist\",\"fa\":\"جنگیر آبی\",\"fr\":\"Blue Exorcist\",\"he\":\"מגרש השדים הכחול\",\"ja\":\"青の祓魔師\",\"pl\":\"Ao No Exorcist\",\"ro\":\"Exorcistul albastru\",\"ru\":\"Синий экзорцист\",\"th\":\"เอ็กซอร์ซิสต์พันธุ์ปีศาจ\",\"x-jat\":\"AoEx\",\"zh-Hans\":\"青之驱魔师\"},\"studios\":[],\"trailer\":{\"id\":\"ayLq7BKjQZU\",\"site\":\"YouTube\"},\"backdrop\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/graphical/248035-g.jpg\",\"duration\":24,\"episodes\":25,\"overview\":\"Humans and demons are two sides of the same coin, as are Assiah and Gehenna, their respective worlds. The only way to travel between the realms is by the means of possession, like in ghost stories. However, Satan, the ruler of Gehenna, cannot find a suitable host to possess and therefore, remains imprisoned in his world. In a desperate attempt to conquer Assiah, he sends his son instead, intending for him to eventually grow into a vessel capable of possession by the demon king.Ao no Exorcist follows Rin Okumura who appears to be an ordinary, somewhat troublesome teenager—that is until one day he is ambushed by demons. His world turns upside down when he discovers that he is in fact the very son of Satan and that his demon father wishes for him to return so they can conquer Assiah together. Not wanting to join the king of Gehenna, Rin decides to begin training to become an exorcist so that he can fight to defend Assiah alongside his brother Yukio.\\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"ayLq7BKjQZU\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Rin Okumura\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/33329/image/tiny-6c6c70d4440311d85461fa27bdf0ef37.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Akeno Watanabe\"},{\"name\":\"Miketsu\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/102825/image/tiny-74eb49764146e396e26c83ac33fdc79f.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Go Inoue\"},{\"name\":\"Amaimon\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/33331/image/tiny-2d351d210d0744cafea359b6c9a3e43d.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Tetsuya Kakihara\"},{\"name\":\"Arthur Auguste Angel\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/33337/image/tiny-fe9543f235848bbb3413275caa3e4558.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Daisuke Ono\"},{\"name\":\"Ernst Frederick Egin\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/33339/image/tiny-9b88931a1aa0ea6fb56d9cf10e551873.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Toshihiko Miki\"},{\"name\":\"Yuri Frederick Egin\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/33338/image/tiny-18b6c1ea8b485e91bafa8260d54436d7.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Megumi Hayashibara